  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A particle enters a uniform magnetic field and follows a circular path. The mass of the particle is <em>m</em>, its charge is <em>q</em> and its speed as it moves in the magnetic field is <em>v</em>. The direction of the magnetic field, <em>B</em>, is out of the page.</p>\n<p>What is the radius of the path of the particle and what particle is it? </p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Radius of the path</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Particle</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mv}{Bq}\"></span></td>\n<td>Electron</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mv^{2}}{Bq}\"></span></td>\n<td>Electron</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mv}{Bq}\"></span></td>\n<td>Proton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mv^{2}}{Bq}\"></span></td>\n<td>Proton</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
